Investigation plan, change plan, RCA hypotheses
Confidence/evidence, deterministic rules remain authoritative
Transactional with confirmation
Prepare a state change and execute after explicit user confirmation
Submit request, add safe update
Identity binding, schema validation, confirmation and audit
