"Complete" labels apply to AuthClaw SRS items, not the separate ITSM capability catalog.


Final assumption
Where the ITSM workbook listed multiple interchangeable technologies, this specification commits to the interface, security and reliability objective while labeling the concrete vendor choice as proposed. The shared AuthClaw technologies are treated as the default unless an architecture decision record demonstrates that another choice better preserves the same controls.
